        <li Class="ScenPart_ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart">
          <def>ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart</def>
          <thingDef>Steel</thingDef>
          <count>200</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart">
          <def>ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart</def>
          <thingDef>WoodLog</thingDef>
          <count>250</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
          <def>GameStartDialog</def>
          <text>Three weeks of walking, and the guns behind you have finally gone quiet. This valley is as far from the front as your boots could carry you.\n\nNobody here knows your names. Not yet.</text>
