  <!-- ===================== Bad Blood ===================== -->

  <ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
    <defName>Council_Scenario_BadBlood</defName>
    <label>Bad Blood</label>
    <description>Two families, one valley, and three generations of bad blood. When the colony ship broke apart, the only pods that launched carried the last of two clans who haven't shared a meal in living memory. Now they share everything.\n\nEach family takes one name and stands by its own. Whether they can stand each other is another question. Expect cold shoulders, a few harsh words, rivalries, and a council where every vote is a family vote.\n\nNobody is coming to attack you: the trouble is all at home. The grudge fades over a month or two, faster if the families find a reason to work together.</description>
    <scenario>
      <summary>Six survivors from two feuding families, forced to build one colony together. No extra fights, just drama. (Rimfolk · gentle)</summary>
      <playerFaction>
        <def>PlayerFaction</def>
        <factionDef>PlayerColony</factionDef>
      </playerFaction>
      <parts>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ConfigPage_ConfigureStartingPawns">
