  <!-- ===================== The Fallen Tyrant ===================== -->

  <ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
    <defName>Council_Scenario_FallenTyrant</defName>
    <label>The Fallen Tyrant</label>
    <description>For years the warlord ruled this valley with a whip and a smile. Last night, at the feast, five of the servants poured the wine. This morning the warlord is sleeping it off in the dirt, and the valley is yours.\n\nYou have a few hours to find somewhere to keep a tyrant. In a week or so the warlord's loyalists will come to find out what happened, and twice more after that, a month or so apart, unless their master is dead or one of you by then.\n\nWhat to do with the person in chains is the colony's first real decision. Everyone has an opinion. None of them are kind.</description>
    <scenario>
      <summary>Five former servants, one drugged tyrant, and the tyrant's loyalists on their way back. (Rimfolk · challenging)</summary>
      <playerFaction>
        <def>PlayerFaction</def>
        <factionDef>PlayerColony</factionDef>
      </playerFaction>
      <parts>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ConfigPage_ConfigureStartingPawns">
          <def>ConfigPage_ConfigureStartingPawns</def>
          <pawnCount>5</pawnCount>
          <pawnChoiceCount>10</pawnChoiceCount>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_PlayerPawnsArriveMethod">
          <def>PlayerPawnsArriveMethod</def>
          <method>Standing</method>
        </li>

        <li Class="ColonyCouncil.ScenPart_CouncilFoe">
          <def>Council_ScenFoe</def>
          <deed>enslaved</deed>
          <outlaws>true</outlaws>
          <captive>true</captive>
          <firstDays>7~10</firstDays>
          <everyDays>30~40</everyDays>
          <times>3</times>
          <story>tyrant</story>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
