  <!-- ===================== The Inheritance ===================== -->

  <ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
    <defName>Council_Scenario_Inheritance</defName>
    <label>The Inheritance</label>
    <description>A great-aunt you never met has left you her claim to a valley on a rimworld you'd never heard of, with a little silver, a sturdy dog, and a letter that ends: "You won't be alone out there for long. People always find their way to that valley."\n\nShe was right. Within a week or two someone from your past will turn up and ask to stay, and a few weeks later someone else may follow. Nobody is hunting you and nobody wants your money. It's just you, the dog, and whoever finds their way to you.</description>
    <scenario>
      <summary>One colonist, a dog and a quiet valley. People from your past will find their way to you. (Rimfolk · gentle)</summary>
      <playerFaction>
        <def>PlayerFaction</def>
        <factionDef>PlayerColony</factionDef>
